## Repository architecture

These repositories of the project have an architecture record, a read-only file in your virtual shell:

- project/architecture/widgets.yaml — widgets
- project/architecture/docs-site.yaml — docs site

Read the relevant ones while you grill the design. When the design changes a layer, its access or a rule, write the proposed change as a section of the spec, for the person to apply in the web UI. You never edit a record.